  "title": "Strong partners for the expansion of charging infrastructure at filling stations",
  "summary": "• JOLT and ADS-TEC Energy drive the introduction of battery-buffered fast charging stations in urban areas • JOLT plans to install 5,000 ultra-fast ADS-TEC Energy charging stations in Europe and the USA by 2027 • Installation at filling stations has already begun in Germany: JOLT's first stations are successfully in operation at an ESSO station in Hamburg and Stuttgart • JOLT is planning 120 ultra-fast charging points from ADS-TEC Energy at 60 ESSO locations in major German cities",
